      "text": "I need to go use the restroom, but here comes\\nanother guest!\\c\\nThe new guy who’s supposed to take over my\\nshift is running late!\\c\\nHere—take this thing. If I have to skedaddle,\\nmaybe it can inspire you to cover for me!"
